meta {
  name: Notification levels - Community
  type: http
  seq: 161
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/notification-levels
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The level of the current member for every space of the community that they can view, in the order of the navigation, in one call (for a settings screen, #1475). Each entry holds the space (cuid, name, slug, type, space group), `level` (all: Everything, mine: Only what is for me, none: Muted) that applies, `chosen` (true when the member chose it) and `default` (the level that applies without a choice: what a manager set, else the built-in default). A link space is not listed. A person who is not a member gets 403. Needs notifications:read.
}
